        """Current counters, range totals and the application time series


        CCU (`peak_sessions`), session and participant minutes, unique users, active channels and
        metered counters per bucket. Lifecycle metrics (CCU, minutes, unique users) are derived from
        session and membership intervals by a fleet-wide aggregator that runs every
        `usage.aggregate_interval_secs`; metered counters (media bytes, chat, TTS, STT) are flushed by
        every node every `usage.flush_interval_secs`. Buckets before `range.finalized_through` are
        final; the current one is still accruing. Clock-time is UTC; buckets are aligned to epoch
        multiples of the step.

        `GET /v1/analytics`
        Auth: ApiKeyHeader | ApiKeyBearer.
        Permissions: analytics:read.
        """
        return self._json("GET", "/v1/analytics", query={"from": from_, "to": to, "step": step}, options=options)  # type: ignore[no-any-return]

